From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:25:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [ofono] Test merge and split, also with two modems.

Covers the call control the ofono plugin gained with merge() and
split():

- merge() asks oFono for CreateMultiparty only for an active and a held
  call on the same modem, and reports anything else as an error.
- A failed CreateMultiparty or PrivateChat is reported once.
- split() only asks for PrivateChat on a call in a conference.
- Call control on a handler whose modem lost its voice call interface,
  before the handler's deferred delete, reaches no call manager.

And two cases for a dual SIM phone, which has one provider and one call
manager per modem:

- Calls on different modems can't be merged: oFono joins calls on one
  modem only.
- One modem losing its voice call interface takes only its own calls;
  the other modem's call becomes the active call and can still be
  controlled.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
